Voidward and downward from Hallia's city centre, the district sprawls across an undeveloped stretch of factory land. For all its grime, Sableclutch holds more churches than you'd expect — mostly devoted to the [[Host]], with a scatter of other gods tucked between the warehouses — whilst [[Sableclutch Scrap]] will put anyone to work who turns up willing, its giant crusher the district's unofficial landmark.
